{
  "key": 8345,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Fellow Trainer!\r",
        "Your Pokémon are secure inside their\n",
        "Poké Balls, but there’s no masking\\fthat aura of serious toughness!\r",
        "Oops, sorry, I should introduce\n",
        "myself.\r",
        "The name’s Flint! I’m one of\n",
        "the Pokémon League’s Elite Four!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I just had this idea.\n",
        "Maybe you can pull it off.\r",
        "It’s about this town’s Gym Leader.\r",
        "He’s really lost his enthusiasm lately\n",
        "because there’ve been so few good\\fchallengers worth his time.\r",
        "He’s been so bored, he spends all his\n",
        "time renovating the Gym.\r",
        "And then the blackout happened...\n",
        "That sure didn’t help lift his mood.\r",
        "You know where I’m going with this,\n",
        "don’t you?\r",
        "I need you to give him a battle\n",
        "that’s so hot, it will reignite his\\fpassion for battling.\r",
        "I’m counting on you, hotshot!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Flint: Yo! Hiya!\n",
        "He hasn’t come back yet.\r",
        "When he does, you know what you’ve\n",
        "gotta do.\r",
        "Give him a battle that’s so hot, it\n",
        "will reignite his passion for battling!\r",
        "I’m counting on you, hotshot!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Flint: Yo! Hiya!\n",
        "He’s finally come back!\r",
        "He seemed to be feeling upbeat, too.\r",
        "I have a hunch that he recognized\n",
        "your toughness right away.\r",
        "I bet he’s getting excited over\n",
        "the thought of battling you.\r",
        "Remember what you have to do,\n",
        "hotshot.\r",
        "Give him a battle that’s so hot, it\n",
        "will reignite his passion for battling!\r",
        "All right, hotshot! I’ll be waiting at\n",
        "the Pokémon League!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "...Er...um... M-my name is Jasmine,\n",
        "and I’m a Gym Leader.\r",
        "Oh, I’m sorry, not the Gym Leader\n",
        "of this town...\r",
        "I’m a Gym Leader in the Johto\n",
        "region...\r",
        "...Er...um...\n",
        "It would be nice if you knew about\\fthe Johto region...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, if you don’t have the Gym Badge,\n",
        "you’ll be forced to turn back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, that’s this town’s Gym Badge.\n",
        "You must be very good.\r",
        "...Er...um...\n",
        "P-please take this, too.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "...That Hidden Machine...\n",
        "It contains Waterfall.\r",
        "If you use it, you can get to\n",
        "the Pokémon League.\r",
        "...Um... I... I don’t know how\n",
        "I should say this, but good luck."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...This city makes me feel\n",
        "at home somehow.\r",
        "It’s next to the sea, and there’s\n",
        "a lighthouse...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...I came from very far away\n",
        "because I wanted to get stronger.\r",
        "On the way, I met all sorts of \n",
        "people with their Pokémon...\r",
        "They all looked like they were having\n",
        "fun. I felt happy seeing it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00010",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "That giant rock...\n",
        "Isn’t it really a Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00012",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gym Leader uses too much\n",
        "electricity!\r",
        "He needs to think about the city’s\n",
        "power needs, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "The city uses a lot of electricity,\n",
        "especially the lighthouse and\\fthe Gym.\r",
        "They finally decided to turn all\n",
        "the roads inside the city into giant\\fsolar panels.\r",
        "Sunyshore is the Sunshine City, so\n",
        "the system works perfectly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "This is a major port town.\n",
        "And...\r",
        "It’s the gateway to the Pokémon\n",
        "League."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1156_SC08_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Whatever the environment, people\n",
        "and Pokémon adapt to live there.\r",
        "That’s what we all do to survive."
      ]
    },
    {
